{
  "id": "fox-shine-grab",
  "name": "Shine grab",
  "part": "tech",
  "characters": [
    "fox"
  ],
  "goal": "Shine, jump out of it, and grab during jump squat.",
  "why": "An opponent who holds shield through the shine is safe from it but not from a grab. Fox cancels the shine with a jump and the jump squat with a grab, so the grab comes out {4} frames after the shine without Fox leaving the ground.",
  "tutorial": {
    "camera": {
      "follow": "player",
      "distance": 90,
      "height": 8
    },
    "what": "A shine grab is a shine, a jump out of it on frame {4}, and Z on the second or third frame of the jump squat. The grab replaces the jump, so Fox never leaves the ground.",
    "expect": "Each shine grab is judged when the grab comes out, or when Fox leaves the ground without one: the frame of the jump and whether the jump squat became a grab. After misses, the coach shows your inputs frame by frame against these frames.",
    "example": [
      {
        "stick": [
          0,
          -1
        ],
        "frame": 1
      },
      {
        "press": "B",
        "frame": 1
      },
      {
        "press": "jump",
        "frame": 4,
        "hold": 1
      },
      {
        "press": "Z",
        "frame": 5,
        "hold": 1
      }
    ],
    "marks": {
      "1": "Frame 1: down-B. The shine comes out",
      "4": "Frame {4}: X pressed. The jump squat begins",
      "5": "Frame {5}: Z pressed. The jump squat becomes a grab",
      "J+4": "Frame {J+4}: grabbing, still on the ground"
    },
    "lessons": [
      {
        "title": "Grab out of the jump squat",
        "text": [
          "Before {char} leaves the ground, the jump squat accepts three actions: a grab, an up smash and up-B. Z pressed on any frame of the jump squat replaces the jump with a standing grab on that frame.",
          "From standing, Z pressed on the same frame as the jump grabs at once. Z pressed on the frame {char} leaves the ground is a neutral air."
        ],
        "show": {
          "example": {
            "inputs": [
              {
                "press": "jump",
                "frame": 1,
                "hold": 1
              },
              {
                "press": "Z",
                "frame": 2,
                "hold": 1
              }
            ],
            "marks": {
              "1": "Frame 1: X pressed. The jump squat begins",
              "2": "Frame 2: Z pressed. The jump squat becomes a grab",
              "3": "Frame {f}: grabbing, still on the ground"
            },
            "cues": [
              {
                "frames": [
                  1,
                  1
                ],
                "words": "Jump squat",
                "kind": "info"
              },
              {
                "frames": [
                  2,
                  "J"
                ],
                "words": "Press Z now: grab",
                "kind": "go"
              },
              {
                "frames": [
                  "J+1",
                  "J+20"
                ],
                "words": "Grabbing",
                "kind": "info"
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "title": "From the shine",
        "text": [
          "The shine accepts a jump from its fourth frame, and nothing else: Z pressed together with that jump is not seen, and Fox jumps. Z has to come on a later frame of the jump squat, frame {5} or {J+3} after a jump on frame {4}.",
          "One frame later, on frame {J+4}, Fox is in the air and Z is a neutral air."
        ],
        "show": {
          "example": {
            "inputs": [
              {
                "stick": [
                  0,
                  -1
                ],
                "frame": 1
              },
              {
                "press": "B",
                "frame": 1
              },
              {
                "press": "jump",
                "frame": 4,
                "hold": 1
              },
              {
                "press": "Z",
                "frame": 5,
                "hold": 1
              }
            ],
            "marks": {
              "1": "Frame 1: down-B",
              "4": "Frame {4}: X pressed out of the shine. Z now is not seen",
              "5": "Frame {5}: Z pressed. The jump squat becomes a grab",
              "J+4": "Frame {J+4}: grabbing"
            },
            "cues": [
              {
                "frames": [
                  1,
                  3
                ],
                "words": "Too soon: a jump is ignored",
                "kind": "late"
              },
              {
                "frames": [
                  4,
                  4
                ],
                "words": "Jump now",
                "kind": "go"
              },
              {
                "frames": [
                  5,
                  "J+3"
                ],
                "words": "Press Z now: grab",
                "kind": "go"
              },
              {
                "frames": [
                  "J+4",
                  "J+24"
                ],
                "words": "Grabbing",
                "kind": "info"
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      }
    ]
  },
